{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"kotlin","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Kotlin","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Kotlin (.kt .kts).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"kotlin","name":"Kotlin","extensions":[".kt",".kts"],"grammar":"grammars/kotlin.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Kotlin","path":"snippets/kotlin.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/kotlin.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:constructor|crossinline|annotation|companion|interface|protected|typealias|abstract|continue|external|internal|lateinit|noinline|operator|override|dynamic|finally|package|private|reified|suspend|tailrec|actual|expect|import|inline|object|public|return|sealed|typeof|vararg|break|catch|class|const|final|infix|inner|super|throw|value|where|while|data|else|enum|init|lazy|open|this|when|for|fun|get|out|set|try|val|var|as|by|do|if|in|is|it)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Sequence|Boolean|Nothing|Double|Number|String|Array|Float|Short|Byte|Char|List|Long|Pair|Unit|Any|Int|Map|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:mutableListOf|mutableMapOf|println|arrayOf|require|listOf|print|mapOf|setOf|check|error|apply|TODO|lazy|also|with|run|let)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/kotlin.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fun\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fun ${1:name}(${2:args}): ${3:Unit} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Data class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"data\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"data class ${1:Name}(val ${2:field}: ${3:String})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A data class\"\n  },\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fun main() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The main function\"\n  },\n  \"When\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"when\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"when (${1:x}) {\",\n      \"\\t${2:value} -> $0\",\n      \"\\telse -> TODO()\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A when expression\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for (${1:item} in ${2:items}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Print\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"println(${1:value})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"println\"\n  },\n  \"Coroutine launch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"launch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"launch {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Launch a coroutine\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Kotlin\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Kotlin.\n\n## Files\n\n`.kt`, `.kts`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 8 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fun` | A function |\n| `data` | A data class |\n| `main` | The main function |\n| `when` | A when expression |\n| `for` | A for loop |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `pl` | println |\n| `launch` | Launch a coroutine |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}